		(property "Description" "Local wiring to the 0.96in SSD1315 OLED breakout, I2C0 bus (NOT the shared UART link to host). Pin1=SDA(GP8), Pin2=SCL(GP9), Pin3=GND, Pin4=+3.3V (from Pico 3V3 OUT, regulated). Breakout board's own header pin order (commonly GND,VCC,SCL,SDA) may differ; match by hand when the physical board arrives (same open item as password_design_notes.md). Address 0x3C, board's own pull-ups used (no external pull-up on this connector)."
